// Foundations: the maths and statistics the Core Principles exams assume,
// taught from zero. Two subjects, FM and FS, that behave like any other
// subject (modules, flashcards, drills, spaced repetition) but are not IFoA
// exams: they are left out of EXAMS, so they never appear in the exam
// planner, the route map, results or the qualification count.
//
// Same shapes as data.js (SUBJECTS / MODULES) and drills.js (DRILLS), plus
// one extra per module: `lesson`, a short HTML explainer shown above the
// flashcards. Card progress is keyed by position, so only ever append cards
// to a module. Drill ids are stable and must never be reused.

const FOUNDATIONS = ["FM", "FS"];

